/-! ### H-pentagonal exponent `j(5j+3)/2`

Fixed by `theta_sum_2_eq_jacobiSeries` (Ch04: `∑'_j (-1)^j q^(j(5j+3)/2)`),
not a guessed convention. Mechanical infrastructure parallel to the
